DoomGeneric
  https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric
  Snapshot: e257a09527062bfb986b6e5e0780839b6cbd5b71
  Doom by id Software; original source cleanup by Bernd Kreimeier.
  GPL-2.0-or-later; see components/doom_engine/LICENSE and source headers.
  Sources are downloaded into .local/deps/doomgeneric at build time, checked
  against a pinned SHA256 and patched from components/doom_engine/patches/.
  Local changes: RGB565 allocation and palette conversion, diagnostic format
  fixes, a read-only mapped IWAD and task-scoped error/exit handling.
  Firmware incorporating this engine is subject to its GPL terms; the template
  licenses do not replace them. Game data is separately licensed. The Doom 1.9
  shareware IWAD is fetched and verified during the build, not stored in Git.

Fumo model and texture
